<#entry-task-12-pin-refetch-after-failure-decision-01> schema:text "Constraint (Angelo, 2026-10-20): the failing test must be fixed by changing the test, not the implementation — production code stays untouched. The re-fetch is driven inside the test through the session boundary: grab the PodOS instance via pod-os:loaded and push a session emission (isLoggedIn: true) through os.observeSession(), which triggers PodOS's flagAuthorizationMetadata() tap and pos-resource's session watch to re-fetch. Core-level flagAuthorizationMetadata pin (Option B) was offered and not taken up; re-introducing force: true (Option C) stays rejected.".
<#plan> dct:modified "2026-10-20T19:38:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
