<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-goal-01> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "Resolve the findings of the two-axis review of task-07 (2026-10-15): remove the redundant logged-out clear(), pin the NOT-cached bullet in its own test, key logged-out detection on isLoggedIn instead of !webId, and prove the PodOs-level chain tap -> re-login -> rebuild end to end.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    dct:created "2026-10-15T09:12:19Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-scope-01> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "SearchGateway.buildSearchIndex(): drop the this.clear() call in the logged-out branch (spec review: scope creep — scope-03 only asks for a fresh, uncached empty index; the extra clear empties held references on a mere demand call, which no spec line requests). The logged-in path stays covered by the session tap, which empties in place on every session change.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    dct:created "2026-10-15T09:12:19Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-scope-02> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "SearchGateway logged-out detection keys on session.isLoggedIn instead of truthiness of webId (spec review suggestion: a session with isLoggedIn: false plus a stale webId would currently build against the wrong user). Logged-in semantics unchanged (webId read from the session, fetchProfile, build + cache).";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    dct:created "2026-10-15T09:12:19Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-scope-03> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "SearchGateway.spec: the test 'builds an empty index without caching it when logged out' gets its own NOT-cached assertion (a later logged-in call builds — fetchAll called) per verification-01 of task-07; today that part is only pinned in the adjacent follow-up test. Extract the duplicated default session data in fakeSession()/setupWithFakeStore() while there (test-principles: extract infrastructure; drop the pass-through parameter).";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    dct:created "2026-10-15T09:12:19Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-scope-04> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "PodOs.spec: extend the session-change test so a single test proves the full chain — build while logged in, session change (tap fires), re-login emission, next buildSearchIndex() call rebuilds (new instance, fetchAll called again). Today the tap-driven rebuild proof is split across PodOs.spec and SearchGateway.spec and the not.toBe assertion would pass even without clear() because the logged-out branch already returns a fresh index.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    dct:created "2026-10-15T09:12:19Z"^^xsd:dateTime.
<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-verification-01> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "All core suites stay green; the logged-out test now fails when the NOT-cached expectation is violated; the PodOs.spec chain test fails if the tap no longer clears (proven red before implementation, per TDD); the ab0e358a behaviour stays covered by the remaining logged-out invalidation test if kept — otherwise fold its assertions into the pinned test.";
