<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-note-01> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "Code observation (Angelo, on SearchGateway.buildSearchIndex): reading the session with this.session.observeSession().getValue().webId is an anti-pattern — observable values must not be accessed synchronously; to be addressed together with the isLoggedIn keying of scope-02.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://angelo.veltens.org/profile/card#me>;
