<#entry-task-08-review-fixes-search-demand-api-note-02> a schema:Comment;
    schema:text "Process feedback on LLM-extruded commit messages (Angelo, citing b46e10d234cc5e73bac3f28f63776366da7c5b00 as an example): commit messages have become too verbose — the llm-extruded-commits skill was updated so that bodies stay short and only explain the WHY of a change, never mirror the WHAT.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://angelo.veltens.org/profile/card#me>;
